<title>FRANCE: Insurer Axa has 91.39 percent of UAP - SBF.</title>
<headline>Insurer Axa has 91.39 percent of UAP - SBF.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French bourses association (SBF) said on Monday that insurer Axa held 91.39 percent of UAP following counting after the January 6 closure date for replies from financial intermediaries.</p>
<p>The two companies announced a share and certificate exchange in mid-November for a merger that will create the world's second largest insuer.</p>
<p>The SBF said in a statement it would announce later on the date for stock exchange admission of the new merged shares and certificates of guaranteed value.</p>
</text>
